\f1\fs22 When Hayley alighted from the ground cab at Shakti\'92s police cordon around the mansion in the Ghetto, she heard the noise coming from above the Layer, and shivered. The ice in her bowels fired an alert to the lizard part of her brain that fixated her on an image of a PAPER gunship strafing the apartment she\'92d only recently narrowly escaped. Her peaking fear tried to throw her to the ground, certain the ground car was seconds from being turned into particle-blasted roadkill. With more steel than her bones possessed, she ducked under the cordon, flashed her badge, and stalked off to find Shakti.\
